WEBVTT

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:05.160
System Change!

00:00:26.330 --> 00:00:29.000
Symmetrical Docking, approved!

00:00:29.420 --> 00:00:32.050
HyoRyu, EnRyu, SympaRate set!

00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:34.550
Symmetrical Docking!

00:00:35.800 --> 00:00:37.470
SympaRate, 98!

00:00:37.550 --> 00:00:40.270
95! 89! 82!

00:00:40.350 --> 00:00:42.520
It's no good, their SympaRate isn't rising!

00:00:48.980 --> 00:00:50.440
Docking failed!

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:51.900
Now assessing damage...

00:00:52.900 --> 00:00:55.280
No threat of an explosion!

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:56.910
Simulation over.

00:00:57.530 --> 00:01:00.660
It can't be helped. Let's just call it a day.

00:01:00.990 --> 00:01:02.870
HyoRyu and EnRyu...

00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:07.000
...when their identical A.I. Startup Pattern SympaRate exceeds 90%...

00:01:07.130 --> 00:01:12.050
...they will be able to achieve Symmetrical Docking.

00:01:12.630 --> 00:01:16.050
But so far there are few encouraging signs...

00:01:16.340 --> 00:01:21.930
Therefore, the ultimate megaton tool, the Eraser Head, remains out of reach.

00:01:22.180 --> 00:01:25.180
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:25.180 --> 00:01:28.080
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:29.150 --> 00:01:35.070
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:35.430 --> 00:01:39.080
Rise in fury, Steel Cyborg!

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:45.800
With your red mane and golden arms!

00:01:47.120 --> 00:01:50.080
Your G-Stone sparkling in the sun...

00:01:50.080 --> 00:01:55.000
All the world's hope is in your hands.

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:58.920
Your time has come to make a stand!

00:01:58.920 --> 00:02:01.720
Crushing the hopes of the people...

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:05.480
The Zonders will pay the price!

00:02:07.630 --> 00:02:10.480
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:02:10.480 --> 00:02:13.650
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:16.190
Final Fusion, approved!

00:02:16.390 --> 00:02:19.320
Now transform into a superhero!

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:22.280
Warping dimensional space!

00:02:22.530 --> 00:02:26.360
Dividing Driver!

00:02:28.180 --> 00:02:34.000
A miracle! A mystery! The truth! A dream!

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:39.880
A gigantic, invincible guardian is born!

00:02:39.880 --> 00:02:42.830
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:42.830 --> 00:02:46.720
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:46.350 --> 00:02:48.980
This is the story of the brave men and women...

00:02:49.060 --> 00:02:51.980
...who fight with all their hearts to save mankind.

00:02:54.110 --> 00:02:54.150
His Name is ChoRyuJin

00:02:55.400 --> 00:02:57.400
<i>His Name is ChoRyuJin</i>

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:16.710
Now confirming voiceprint.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:22.680
Please state your name, age, department, and I.D. in a clear voice.

00:03:23.930 --> 00:03:26.140
Mamoru Amami, 9 years old.

00:03:26.430 --> 00:03:28.310
Department and I.D. number...

00:03:28.470 --> 00:03:30.020
...I don't have either!

00:03:33.690 --> 00:03:34.980
Your identity has been confirmed.

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:38.150
This elevator will now take you to...

00:03:38.230 --> 00:03:41.240
...the Negative Levels of the Space Development Corporation, and...

00:03:41.360 --> 00:03:44.240
...directly to the Main Order Room of the GGG Bay Tower Base.

00:03:49.160 --> 00:03:50.250
Waha!

00:03:50.790 --> 00:03:52.750
Hi, Mamoru!

00:03:54.420 --> 00:03:56.090
Welcome to GGG...

00:03:56.340 --> 00:03:58.840
...Special Agent Mamoru Amami!

00:03:59.010 --> 00:04:00.260
Uh, yes, sir...

00:04:00.380 --> 00:04:02.760
Um, I'm very glad to be here!

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:06.390
Exuberant and also well-mannered. How commendable!

00:04:06.930 --> 00:04:09.850
If only Hyuuma would learn from your example.

00:04:15.810 --> 00:04:19.320
This, our Main Order Room, is in the basement of the Space Development...

00:04:19.400 --> 00:04:22.780
...Corporation, 80 meters below sea level.

00:04:22.900 --> 00:04:25.950
Hardly any light reaches us here. It's a quiet little world.

00:04:26.370 --> 00:04:29.910
Chief? Mamoru? Would you please step into the lift circle?

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:32.290
Come with me, Mamoru.

00:04:32.410 --> 00:04:33.250
Huh? Yes, sir.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:37.130
Okay? Lift down!

00:04:37.380 --> 00:04:38.380
Go!

00:04:43.170 --> 00:04:45.720
Mamoru? Come over here and hold on.

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:46.390
Okay!

00:04:47.180 --> 00:04:49.060
The GGG Main Order Room...

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:54.100
The Main Order Room can be directly moved by lowering the floor, or...

00:04:54.190 --> 00:05:00.320
"Lifting Down" to the Big Order Room, located below the Bay Tower Base.

00:05:02.570 --> 00:05:03.860
Oh, waha!

00:05:04.030 --> 00:05:05.280
This place is huge!

00:05:07.530 --> 00:05:09.330
Hey! HyoRyu and EnRyu!

00:05:12.870 --> 00:05:14.370
Hello, Mamoru.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:16.000
Hey there, Mamoru!

00:05:16.540 --> 00:05:17.500
Hey, guys!

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:18.460
Hey!

00:05:19.040 --> 00:05:20.130
Hey, Big Brother Gai!

00:05:22.590 --> 00:05:26.800
This is our Strategic Command Base, the Big Order Room.

00:05:27.970 --> 00:05:29.970
Big Order Room!

00:05:37.600 --> 00:05:41.150
How could my ship have run aground?

00:05:41.860 --> 00:05:44.570
That darned automatic system or whatever is to blame!

00:05:45.240 --> 00:05:49.410
This never would've happened if we hadn't been steering by computer!

00:05:52.870 --> 00:05:55.250
It was better in the good old days...

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:58.830
When my ship and I were two hearts beating as one.

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:00.590
But no more...

00:06:02.880 --> 00:06:04.090
Huh? What, empty already?

00:06:09.340 --> 00:06:13.850
Ah, if it had been you steering that ship, rather than the computer...

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:17.520
...would you have been able to avert the accident?

00:06:18.100 --> 00:06:19.100
Huh?

00:06:21.230 --> 00:06:25.570
We generated images based on the testimony of former Zonder hosts.

00:06:25.610 --> 00:06:28.860
We've concluded that these are the four Zonderians who provided the...

00:06:28.910 --> 00:06:31.030
...impetus for their transformation into Zonders.

00:06:31.280 --> 00:06:32.990
Zonderians?

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:35.580
It appears that they're creating Zonders...

00:06:35.620 --> 00:06:39.330
...by fusing this Zonder Metal with human bodies.

00:06:39.920 --> 00:06:43.250
There's a certain pattern among the Zonders we've questioned so far.

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:45.880
One way or another, they've all carried...

00:06:45.960 --> 00:06:49.220
...either profound hatred or grief in their subconscious.

00:06:49.630 --> 00:06:54.100
In all likelihood, the destruction they caused as Zonders...

00:06:54.260 --> 00:06:57.060
...stemmed from such negative emotions.

00:06:57.140 --> 00:06:59.230
Hatred and grief...

00:06:59.440 --> 00:07:01.150
Negative emotions?

00:07:03.480 --> 00:07:06.280
Let me grant you your wish!

00:07:18.700 --> 00:07:21.080
We've been able to confirm that...

00:07:21.170 --> 00:07:24.460
...Mamoru has the power to turn the Zonder Robos back into humans.

00:07:24.630 --> 00:07:26.420
We still don't know why that is...

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:29.920
...but we've decided to call this power of Mamoru's "Purification".

00:07:30.170 --> 00:07:32.470
Purification?

00:07:32.680 --> 00:07:37.430
At this point, our only feasible strategy is to first send in the Mobile Unit...

00:07:37.560 --> 00:07:42.270
...to attack and subdue the Zonders, so then Mamoru can purify the cores.

00:07:44.150 --> 00:07:45.440
Um, but...

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:47.190
What is it, Mamoru?

00:07:47.530 --> 00:07:48.900
The thing is...

00:07:48.980 --> 00:07:53.160
...whenever a Zonder appears, I can somehow, um, sense where it is.

00:07:53.280 --> 00:07:57.620
So if I can just purify them before they turn into Zonder Robos...

00:07:57.700 --> 00:07:58.950
Mamoru...

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:01.000
...remember how much danger you put yourself into...

00:08:01.120 --> 00:08:02.710
...the last time you tried to confront a Zonder?

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:22.020
But letting the Zonders destroy the city like that...

00:08:22.480 --> 00:08:23.690
I can't bear to see it!

00:08:38.740 --> 00:08:40.240
He does have a point there.

00:08:40.490 --> 00:08:42.160
What a brave child.

00:08:42.410 --> 00:08:45.000
That's a good attitude to have as a GGG member.

00:08:45.210 --> 00:08:47.750
But Mamoru's still just a kid in grammar school!

00:08:48.090 --> 00:08:51.590
I don't know about getting a kid the age of my brother involved in a war.

00:08:52.050 --> 00:08:54.630
He's right! We're at war here!

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:59.470
Well, all the Intelligence Unit can do is provide Mamoru with covert protection.

00:09:00.010 --> 00:09:01.310
Huh? Protection?

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:02.640
That's right.

00:09:02.770 --> 00:09:05.640
If something happens to you, who could help the people being Zonderized?

00:09:08.060 --> 00:09:12.440
You're the only one who can purify Zonder cores and save those people.

00:09:12.610 --> 00:09:14.570
We can't put you in danger.

00:09:14.610 --> 00:09:16.240
Try to understand that.

00:09:16.410 --> 00:09:17.200
Okay.

00:09:19.780 --> 00:09:21.410
Chin up, Mamoru!

00:09:21.490 --> 00:09:24.410
Your courage is giving my A.I. goosebumps!

00:09:24.580 --> 00:09:27.210
Captain, fearing potential danger isn't going to get us anywhere!

00:09:27.420 --> 00:09:31.750
Don't you think we ought to give Mamoru's idea a try?

00:09:32.510 --> 00:09:35.050
No, you're wrong about that EnRyu.

00:09:35.630 --> 00:09:37.430
What do you mean wrong, HyoRyu?

00:09:37.640 --> 00:09:40.260
According to my calculations, what Mamoru suggests...

00:09:40.430 --> 00:09:42.600
...would involve some critical risks, no question.

00:09:43.310 --> 00:09:45.480
How can we safeguard the peace we're afraid of risk?

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:47.810
To get them we don't need calculations, we just need guts!

00:09:48.350 --> 00:09:51.110
What an illogical concept for a robot.

00:09:51.480 --> 00:09:53.400
Are you sure your A.I. isn't defective?

00:09:53.820 --> 00:09:57.200
We have identical A.I. systems, so if I'm defective, so are you!

00:09:57.450 --> 00:10:00.240
If you're only capable of simple calculations, HyoRyu...

00:10:00.370 --> 00:10:02.740
...then maybe you're due for a software upgrade!

00:10:03.490 --> 00:10:04.700
Look, you're way out of line!

00:10:05.500 --> 00:10:07.670
You must be on the verge of a thermo-runaway...

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:09.710
...thanks to your unnecessary equipment.

00:10:09.790 --> 00:10:14.210
Yeah, well I think your Freeze System has frozen up your A. I!

00:10:15.840 --> 00:10:19.220
Heavens, their SympaRate is going to drop for sure now!

00:10:19.340 --> 00:10:21.430
They're robots, though, who knew they'd bicker like that?

00:10:21.510 --> 00:10:23.810
That A.I. of theirs is way too human.

00:10:24.100 --> 00:10:26.270
But I can't believe they'd disagree like that...

00:10:26.350 --> 00:10:29.440
...when they have the same software driving the same A. I...

00:10:30.310 --> 00:10:34.320
It's your combustion engine that's messing up your A.I. program!

00:10:34.440 --> 00:10:35.480
Shut up! I'm a lot more...

00:10:35.650 --> 00:10:38.650
Big Brother Gai, what are we gonna do? It's all my fault...

00:10:38.740 --> 00:10:40.110
Don't worry about it.

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:42.280
These two have been together since the day they were born...

00:10:42.370 --> 00:10:44.160
The closer you are, the more you fight, see?

00:10:47.120 --> 00:10:48.290
Big Brother Gai!

00:10:48.370 --> 00:10:50.120
A Zonder? Did you just sense one?

00:10:50.460 --> 00:10:51.130
Yeah.

00:10:51.920 --> 00:10:53.460
Something's wrong!

00:10:56.510 --> 00:10:57.420
Hey, what's going on?

00:10:57.720 --> 00:11:00.340
That thing's not sucking up all the gasoline, is it?

00:11:00.930 --> 00:11:04.430
Zonder!

00:11:18.860 --> 00:11:21.860
It's the start of a fun-filled voyage!

00:11:22.450 --> 00:11:25.370
Zonder!

00:11:37.630 --> 00:11:41.760
It's a Zonder sighting just offshore the Kashima Rinkai industrial area!

00:11:43.430 --> 00:11:45.600
GGG Mobile Unit, prepare for action!

00:11:46.260 --> 00:11:49.140
Now displaying the satellite view on the Main Screen.

00:11:51.140 --> 00:11:52.650
I can't believe how huge it is!

00:11:52.850 --> 00:11:56.070
Wow! Approximate size, 300 meters tall!

00:11:56.320 --> 00:11:58.440
I have some staggering news, people...

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:02.740
That Zonder is carrying several hundred thousand tons of gasoline!

00:12:03.160 --> 00:12:04.070
What did you say?

00:12:06.160 --> 00:12:08.790
If that Zonder Robo explodes where it is right now...

00:12:08.870 --> 00:12:10.620
...the projected damages would amount to...

00:12:13.330 --> 00:12:16.420
...total destruction within a 20 km radius!

00:12:16.840 --> 00:12:21.170
It will take at least three hours to evacuate the area of all civilians.

00:12:22.680 --> 00:12:23.470
Where's Gai?

00:12:23.800 --> 00:12:26.350
Gai and Galeon, fusion complete.

00:12:27.390 --> 00:12:30.100
GaiGar is now in StealthGao mode.

00:12:30.770 --> 00:12:31.850
Launch!

00:12:52.620 --> 00:12:56.170
Ushiyama! What's the status on the Dividing Driver and Eraser Head?

00:12:56.250 --> 00:12:57.540
All set to go, sir!

00:12:57.790 --> 00:13:00.210
Landing and Supply Assault Ship, we have liftoff!

00:13:35.460 --> 00:13:36.960
HyoRyu, stand by!

00:13:40.920 --> 00:13:43.210
Mirror Coating, start!

00:13:45.220 --> 00:13:47.180
The Mirror Catapult is ready to go, sir!

00:13:47.510 --> 00:13:50.550
All right! HyoRyu, EnRyu, launch!

00:13:50.640 --> 00:13:51.930
HyoRyu, launch!

00:13:58.440 --> 00:14:00.610
EnRyu, launch!

00:14:13.040 --> 00:14:14.830
I'm worried about HyoRyu and EnRyu.

00:14:15.410 --> 00:14:17.960
I hope the Eraser Head won't go to waste...

00:14:18.290 --> 00:14:19.250
No worries!

00:14:19.540 --> 00:14:22.210
Those two have become genuine heroes, after all!

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:37.850
I don't believe the size of that robot!

00:14:39.480 --> 00:14:43.980
Let's make sure it doesn't explode, or the whole city will be ravaged!

00:14:44.360 --> 00:14:46.030
Where's the Dividing Driver?

00:14:50.990 --> 00:14:53.660
Attack, and this entire area will be engulfed in flames.

00:14:53.740 --> 00:14:55.490
He doesn't stand a chance!

00:14:55.700 --> 00:14:59.500
This time around, we'll achieve our objective!

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:14.680
Are you all right, EnRyu?

00:15:16.100 --> 00:15:18.020
Yeah, somehow I'm still in one piece.

00:15:19.390 --> 00:15:20.940
All right, we're going to start by putting out the fire.

00:15:23.520 --> 00:15:24.860
Chest Thriller!

00:15:30.900 --> 00:15:33.370
Zonder!

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:37.080
Mirror Shield!

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:43.790
EnRyu! If you attack him, the whole city will be destroyed!

00:15:43.960 --> 00:15:45.540
Whoops, that's right!

00:15:47.710 --> 00:15:50.550
Captain, just leave this to us, and...

00:15:50.840 --> 00:15:52.010
...go to Final Fusion mode!

00:15:52.380 --> 00:15:53.010
Right!

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:55.850
Zonder!

00:15:56.560 --> 00:15:59.640
Ah, no you don't! Sorry, but that's as far you're going, buddy!

00:16:00.390 --> 00:16:03.400
Maximum Freezing Energy, extinguishing rate, 130!

00:16:03.730 --> 00:16:09.110
33... 34... 36... 38... 40...

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:14.570
Professor! HyoRyu and EnRyu's SympaRate is on the rise!

00:16:16.070 --> 00:16:18.080
What a couple of simpletons!

00:16:18.620 --> 00:16:21.540
They might be more human than we humans ourselves.

00:16:22.000 --> 00:16:24.000
HyoRyu, EnRyu...

00:16:24.750 --> 00:16:28.590
Final Fusion!

00:17:13.470 --> 00:17:18.180
GaoGaiGar!

00:17:24.230 --> 00:17:27.150
Broken Magnum!

00:17:43.200 --> 00:17:46.040
Dividing Driver, launch!

00:17:47.540 --> 00:17:48.460
All right!

00:17:51.000 --> 00:17:54.210
Dividing Driver!

00:18:14.230 --> 00:18:16.860
Looks like you're too big to get up on your own!

00:18:17.200 --> 00:18:20.200
Hell and Heaven!

00:18:23.040 --> 00:18:24.160
Please wait!

00:18:24.540 --> 00:18:25.700
According to my calculations...

00:18:25.790 --> 00:18:28.790
...if you proceed to rip out the core using Hell and Heaven...

00:18:29.080 --> 00:18:32.130
...you will temporarily leave yourself defenseless, and GaoGaiGar will...

00:18:35.050 --> 00:18:35.880
No!

00:18:37.970 --> 00:18:38.970
Now I get it...

00:18:41.510 --> 00:18:45.220
Although the Battlefield will contain the explosion's damage and save the city...

00:18:46.520 --> 00:18:49.690
Even with all that armor, the shock waves will crush Gai...

00:19:00.320 --> 00:19:01.280
Captain...

00:19:01.280 --> 00:19:02.030
Captain!

00:19:02.530 --> 00:19:04.240
There's no time to think about it!

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:08.710
I'm going to fire the core towards you as soon as I rip it out!

00:19:09.080 --> 00:19:11.040
The rest is up to you!

00:19:11.580 --> 00:19:12.750
No!

00:19:13.000 --> 00:19:14.210
HyoRyu and I...

00:19:14.290 --> 00:19:15.550
EnRyu and I...

00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:19.720
...are not programmed to obey such a command!

00:19:22.970 --> 00:19:23.890
Their SympaRate...

00:19:24.140 --> 00:19:25.760
HyoRyu! EnRyu!

00:19:25.930 --> 00:19:27.770
SympaRate 100%!

00:19:27.930 --> 00:19:30.770
Symmetrical Docking, approved!

00:19:31.020 --> 00:19:34.150
Symmetrical Docking!

00:20:01.340 --> 00:20:06.050
ChoRyuJin!

00:20:09.640 --> 00:20:11.730
Eraser Head, launch!

00:20:50.810 --> 00:20:51.930
ChoRyuJin!

00:20:52.060 --> 00:20:53.640
So you succeeded in docking!

00:20:54.060 --> 00:20:56.230
And you were able to use the Eraser Head!

00:20:56.440 --> 00:20:58.980
Eraser Head, operation successful!

00:21:01.780 --> 00:21:03.950
We've just seen the birth of a new hero.

00:21:04.360 --> 00:21:07.030
The robot brothers, HyoRyu and EnRyu...

00:21:07.160 --> 00:21:10.700
...the moment their A.I. SympaRate reaches its peak...

00:21:10.870 --> 00:21:14.000
...they are able to transform through Symmetrical Docking...

00:21:14.120 --> 00:21:17.750
...and become the high-powered robot, ChoRyuJin.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.800
You did a good job, ChoRyuJin!

00:21:21.210 --> 00:21:23.970
Captain, please forgive me for disobeying your order.

00:21:24.090 --> 00:21:26.680
No, thanks to you I'm saved.

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:29.390
You've got the best A.I. in the world!

00:21:40.900 --> 00:21:43.150
Curatio...

00:21:43.280 --> 00:21:46.820
Teneritas, sectio...

00:21:47.070 --> 00:21:51.030
...salus, coctura!

00:22:04.800 --> 00:22:06.300
Good job, Special Agent Mamoru.

00:22:06.420 --> 00:22:07.470
Waha!

00:22:08.130 --> 00:22:10.720
Hey, ChoRyuJin, you were really cool!

00:22:10.760 --> 00:22:11.930
Thank you.

00:22:12.010 --> 00:22:13.890
Of course, so were you, GaoGaiGar!

00:22:14.100 --> 00:22:17.770
It was everyone's teamwork that earned us this victory!

00:22:22.730 --> 00:22:27.950
The Eraser Head is a megaton tool that can instantly erase explosive energy...

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:31.740
...by redirecting it into space on a pulse of ultra-waves...

00:22:31.870 --> 00:22:35.290
...and only the high-powered robot, ChoRyuJin, can wield it!

00:22:35.410 --> 00:22:40.330
ChoRyuJin, join GaoGaiGar in the battle to protect Earth!

00:22:46.450 --> 00:22:50.350
You come floating down onto my planet.

00:22:51.550 --> 00:22:55.220
That's the dream I always have.

00:22:56.620 --> 00:23:01.400
Now you're looking up at the sky again...

00:23:01.400 --> 00:23:06.190
and you're searching for me.

00:23:06.820 --> 00:23:10.360
Longing to see you and be with you...

00:23:11.530 --> 00:23:17.290
I know I feel it just as strongly as you.

00:23:19.350 --> 00:23:24.050
When you and I are grown up...

00:23:24.050 --> 00:23:28.710
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:29.400 --> 00:23:34.050
Give us the wings to fly

00:23:34.050 --> 00:23:40.950
and set off into the galaxy.

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:48.860
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:51.360
A black bullet train is on the loose!

00:23:51.490 --> 00:23:55.120
Pursue it, HyoRyu, EnRyu, and LinerGao!

00:23:56.030 --> 00:24:00.330
Thanks to a coordinated assault by GGG, the enemy's identity is unmasked!

00:24:00.910 --> 00:24:03.250
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:05.290
"Pursue the Black 300!"

00:24:05.420 --> 00:24:10.340
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:06.750 --> 00:24:10.420
Pursue the Black 300!

00:24:12.430 --> 00:24:15.390
GunDober

00:24:13.220 --> 00:24:14.890
This is the Key to Victory!
